# This folder follows a common structure for setting up ZxMxP MESA grids 
# in this project. All models will follow the MESA physics set in the 
# ZdivZsun_template/template/MESA_input_src folder.
# Edit the inlists and run_star_extras.f90 there before generating the 
# grid. Do not forget to run ./mk in MESA_input_src if you modify the 
# run_star_extras.f90

# Once you have set up MESA_input_src, define for your grid:
# the metallicites over solar in z_div_zsun_grid,
# the ZAMS masses (Msun) in ZdivZsun_template/mass_grid,
# the ZAMS spin periods (d) in ZdivZsun_template/period_grid.

# Then run mk_grid to generate your grid. One folder for each 
# metallicity will be generated, but not the individual MESA inputs. To 
# generate MESA inputs, run ./mk_grid within each metallicity folder. 
# Check the README therein.
# Alternatively, you may uncomment lines 27-29 in ./mk_grid to 
# automatically generate the MESA input folders.

# There is currently no automatic generation of batch run scripts for 
# the full metallicity grids, only for individual metallicities. You 
# must individually dispatch the execution of each metallicity grid. 
# Check the README in the metallicity folders.

# Calling mk_grid will also produce PHYSICS_README, listing changes in
# the inlists, run_star_extras.f90, and MESA history/profile columns 
# relative to x_template.

# If you need to modify the MESA settings, run ./clean to restore the 
# folder to its original configuration, then edit ZdivZsun_template.
